{"id":"b0d9ec4e13e69fcc904778bbf0611f235572893c","url":"https://hub.baai.ac.cn/view/56892","title":"【PODCAST】从上海走向世界：在2026世界人工智能大会展望人工智能治理的未来 - 智源社区","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":"清华大学人工智能国际治理研究院\n                  2026-08-05 19:40 分享","excerpt":"2026世界人工智能大会宣布成立世界人工智能合作组织，旨在弥补现有全球治理在协调机制、标准制定与伦理共识等方面的空白；同时，中国向发展中国家开放5000个AI专题培训名额，推动技术普惠与能力建设，增强全球南方国家参与AI治理与发展的话语权。此举不仅有助于弥合数字鸿沟、促进包容性增长，也体现了多边主义框架下的人工智能全球公共产品供给逻辑，在中美战略竞争背景下，为构建平衡、公正、可持续的AI治理体系提供新路径与实践范例。（150字）","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"js_content\"><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/28dcf29b37687747037d1bd8d31608a01785930001443.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.2101851851851852\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"1080\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"108\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/28dcf29b37687747037d1bd8d31608a01785930001443.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><mp-common-mpaudio data-pluginname=\"insertaudio\" name=\"From Shanghai to the World: What Did WAIC 2026 Tell Us About the Future of AI Governance?\" author=\"清华大学战略与安全研究中心\" src=\"/cgi-bin/readtemplate?t=tmpl/audio_tmpl&name=From%26nbsp%3BShanghai%26nbsp%3Bto%26nbsp%3Bthe%26nbsp%3BWorld%3A%26nbsp%3BWhat%26nbsp%3BDid%26nbsp%3BWAIC%26nbsp%3B2026%26nbsp%3BTell%26nbsp%3BUs%26nbsp%3BAbout%26nbsp%3Bthe%26nbsp%3BFuture%26nbsp%3Bof%26nbsp%3BAI%26nbsp%3BGovernance%3F&play_length=\" isaac2=\"0\" low_size=\"84070.4\" source_size=\"84070.4\" high_size=\"84070.4\" play_length=\"3584000\" data-trans_state=\"1\" data-verify_state=\"3\" voice_encode_fileid=\"MzU2MDk2NDMwN18yMjQ3NTYyNDE3\" cover=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bBaTQvmTUCQs0ZOzWWqfvicdJo0a2GpIWRcExFoc82aYPpf1zWeDfPhsImiclDgqMOecWXmgViciazvvNdg1yaS32jvxOic65OLicVXRrElcpOIdw/0?wx_fmt=jpeg\"></mp-common-mpaudio></section><section data-pm-slice=\"6 4 []\"><section><span><section><strong><span leaf=\"\">导语</span></strong></section></span></section><section><section><span leaf=\"\">当前，全球人工智能治理迈入制度建设新阶段。2026世界人工智能大会暨人工智能全球治理高级别会议推出多项重要成果，尤其值得关注的是世界人工智能合作组织正式宣告成立；中国面向发展中国家开放5000个人工智能专题研修培训名额，支持全球人工智能包容普惠发展。世界人工智能合作组织将填补现有全球治理体系的哪些空白？面向发展中国家开展人工智能能力建设具备何种全球性价值？在中美战略竞争持续升温的背景下，世界人工智能合作组织是否存在双边协作空间？本期《SinoAI Insights》将以上海世界人工智能峰会系列成果为切入点，解读中国人工智能全球治理思路，剖析世界人工智能合作组织全球定位，并探寻在大国战略竞争加剧背景下全球人工智能安全治理的路径及多边合作的可行方案。</span></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">【主持】</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">肖茜</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">清华大学战略与安全研究中心副主任</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">【嘉宾】</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">姚旭&#160;</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">全球人工智能创新治理中心秘书长，复旦大学发展研究院副研究员</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">陈澍&#160;</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">清华大学苏世民书院杰出访问教授，香港大学公民社会与治理研究中心高级研究员，前Meta大中华区公共政策董事总经理</span></p></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" data-pm-slice=\"8 6 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-wrap: wrap;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-bottom: 0px;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-wrap-style: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;powered-by&quot;:&quot;xiumi.us&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;min-height: 40px;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p><strong><span leaf=\"\">您将听到</span></strong></p></secti